    {
      "path": "src/coordinators/daily-review/daily-review.ts",
      "content": "The overview's workspace binding is never validated. `coherently` only checks that the workspace stays unchanged during this call, so an overview retained across Restore can still return Ready when the restored data has the same trade fact revision and market snapshot (for example, restoring a backup of that workspace). Snapshot IDs are evidence hashes and do not include the database identity. Compare the current workspace database name against `request.binding.workspace.databaseName` and return ReviewChanged on a mismatch, so an old overview cannot produce an action/save binding in a replacement workspace.",
